spike/latency/harness
spike/latency/measure
spike/latency/*.wav
spike/latency/*.aiff
spike/latency/*.txt
spike/tap/tap_probe
spike/tap/diag
spike/tap/diag2
spike/tap/*.app/
spike/tap/*.log
spike/tap/*.txt

